  "title": "Easy Chicken Quiche",
  "description": "Turn leftover chicken into this simple and gourmet chicken savory quiche with Gouda cheese. Just a perfect quick and easy dinner.",
  "authors": [
    "Fioa"
  ],
  "date_published": "2018-06-08T10:47:12-04:00",
